    // === NICHO 6: Underwater Heritage (patrimonio-subacuatico.html) ===
    "n6.hero.h1": "Underwater Archaeological Heritage Appraisal",
    "n6.hero.subtitle": "Cataloguing, authentication, and heritage valuation of artifacts and evidence recovered from colonial shipwrecks and underwater archaeological sites.",
    "n6.value.text": "Luis Manuel Almeida Luis applies the same technical appraisal and cataloguing protocols used for terrestrial cultural property to submerged evidence, adjusting the valuation scale to the historical-heritage significance and uniqueness of each recovered artifact.",
    "n6.problem.text": "Wreck recovered goods present severe physical alterations and extreme documentary gaps; without authenticated archaeological appraisal, they risk being plundered, decontextualized, or erroneously catalogued.",
    "n6.cases.title": "Documented Cases",
    "n6.case.1": "Appraisal, technical valuation, and cataloguing of artifacts and archaeological evidence from the colonial shipwreck \"Palemón\" (2001–2004).",
    "n6.case.2": "Appraisal, technical valuation, and cataloguing of artifacts and archaeological evidence from the colonial shipwreck \"Nuestra Señora de las Mercedes\" (2001–2004).",
    "n6.case.3": "Work extended to other underwater archaeological sites during the same period.",
    "n6.services.title": "Specific Appraisal Services",
    "n6.service.1": "Archaeological appraisal reports.",
    "n6.service.1.desc": "Material, typological, dimensional and photographic recording of metals, ceramics and submerged naval architecture elements.",
    "n6.service.2": "Cataloguing records for submerged assets.",
    "n6.service.2.desc": "Typological and material correlation of findings with navigation deros, cargo manifests and historical inventories.",
    "n6.service.3": "Authenticity and historical significance opinions.",
    "n6.service.3.desc": "Descriptive study of incrustations, galvanic corrosion and material stability for the design of consolidation treatments.",
    "n6.service.4": "Heritage Significance Valuation",
    "n6.service.4.desc": "Non-commercial valuation based on archaeological singularity, representativeness and documentary relevance of the submerged site.",
    "n6.cta.main": "Request a Technical Consultation",
    "cta.whatsapp.n6": "Hello, I represent a scientific institution/museum and require an appraisal of underwater archaeological heritage.",
    "n6.cta.form": "Submit a Technical Appraisal Request",
    "n6.phrase.1": "An object recovered from the sea is not a commercial treasure; it is a submerged historical document that demands a surgical expertise rigor to reveal its true provenance.",

